silm:instances_papers_17_commutative_diagrams_as_governance_chapters_05_cheese_trap_immunity_sections_01_cheese_immunity_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'DrawnVsAuditedAsCheeseTrapSeparationYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, arrow 1 of Drawn-vs-audited as cheese-trap separation carries the Mittens body-mass write at 4.7 kg on 2026-05-18T10:00Z through a typed leg of C_17; the audited equation lands the composite into the signed auth-log line under policy CAT-17 with full provenance preserved.; also, arrow 2 of Drawn-vs-audited as cheese-trap separation carries the Mittens body-mass write at 4.7 kg on 2026-05-18T10:00Z through a typed leg of C_17; the audited equation lands the composite into the signed auth-log line under policy CAT-17 with full provenance preserved." .
